# The build context is the repository root (apps/api/Dockerfile). Without this
# file, `COPY apps/api ./apps/api` carried the local apps/api/.env (database URL,
# auth secret, provider keys) into the build stage's layers and any exported
# build cache, and the host's node_modules and dist over the ones the image
# installs and builds for Linux.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.next-verify
**/*.log
.git
.github
.shots
.claude
.kiro
